TT&C SERVICE RENEWAL - CONTRACT
OL-TTC-88412 (CONSTELLATION
GROUND SUPPORT).

Your telemetry, tracking & command
support contract renews January 1
(2028 service year: 14 ground
stations, USD 1,842,000). With the
ground network expansion (four new
stations in the APAC lane), billing
moves to the new network operating
entity from this renewal - details
in Section 2. The renewal window
closes November 15; unrenewed
constellations transition to
best-effort pass scheduling in
2028.

